You need an unblocked exit? You should try going north. You don't like doors? Why not try going south, that entranceway is unguarded.".
The description of r_12 is "[spotless sauna part 0]".

The r_11 is mapped south of r_12.
The r_13 is mapped north of r_12.
Understand "marbled shower" as r_42.
