The messy cellar part 0 is some text that varies. The messy cellar part 0 is "You're now in the messy cellar. The room seems oddly familiar, as though it were only superficially different from the other rooms in the building.



You don't like doors? Why not try going north, that entranceway is unguarded. You need an unblocked exit? You should try going south.".
